{
 "about": "Stash's toolbar as Finder's (docs/adr/0016-windows.mdx): its PageHeader in the pane's Screen, the window's toolbar beside the sidebar, holding the sidebar's toggle, back and forward as ONE Bloom ButtonGroup. The assistive technology receives the group holding its three buttons (Bloom's group view is never flattened away from them: before, React Native's renderer mounted them beside an empty group), side by side inside it, and no other back or forward; back and forward are enabled only where the places visited have somewhere to go, and move with a press and with Ctrl+[ / Ctrl+] (Stash's Go menu).",
 "module": "Stash",
 "window": [
  1024,
  680
 ],
 "app": {
  "id": "so.oxy.stash",
  "title": "Stash"
 },
